{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Do not classify discarded unknown fields as available error details.** Any unknown key counts as nonempty even when its value is `undefined`, but `fromErrorObject` reads only the four known fields. Consequently `{ FutureDetail: undefined }` fabricates an `Unknown error`, while a defined future field loses its value. Ignore unsupported fields when testing for details, or preserve their defined values on the converted error, and assert the resulting value in the test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs78SRDj","finding_digest":"d94b13925de13f929bcde1771412a3892a8f913b2055c6e240c5aba5c0f3547b","finding_id":"arf_v1_3ffrhes54e7zfg6n4f3rievdre","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts::tooperationinfo::unknown-error-detail-preservation","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts::tooperationinfo::unknown-error-detail-preservation","line":48,"observation_digest":"dc2d66f4e4090f4a28e5d11219fdd77d8bb3615076fda121553b24907a521bf6","observation_id":"aro_v1_3qwwn5hebehuukhf2ejbt7oxpw","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/utils/operation/operation.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_3ffrhes54e7zfg6n4f3rievdre","published_at":"2026-10-09T17:10:15Z","review_id":"arr_v1_og3pgajny52xjtlyz5o42sbdnm","reviewed_base_sha":"4ce0ae50323820c74cd4864b7fb29ce3f3822083","reviewed_head_sha":"96b56728c3b81aa3e3ce9c57c8f0c5328c815fe4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":42,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":960},"record_id":"art_v1_6oorc6aasdy5ewbxj24rcrpdha","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T17:10:15Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
